            "pixel". Specifies the anchor point on the y axis to
            which `y0`, `y1` and y coordinates within `path` are
            relative to. E.g. useful to attach a pixel sized shape
            to a certain data value. No effect when `ysizemode` not
            set to "pixel".
        yref
